%S A303146 0,1,49,12680721,1192792774924481365463700438749167129
%N A303146 Number of total dominating sets in the n-transposition graph.
%C A303146 First few terms are squares.
%C A303146 All terms are squares since the graph is bipartite and the two parts are isomorphic. In a bipartite graph each part is independently dominated by the other part. - _Andrew Howroyd_, Jun 11 2025
